 grammar:()=>`
 <div class="gram"><h4>33 letters: friends, false friends, new faces</h4>
 <div class="ig-tldr">Russian has 33 letters. Many look like English — but some are <b>false friends</b>!</div>
 <div class="ig-cards">
  <div class="ig-card n"><i>😊</i><b>А К М О Т Е</b><small>Real friends: same as English (Е = “ye”)</small></div>
  <div class="ig-card f"><i>🎭</i><b>В Н Р С У Х</b><small>False friends: v · n · r · s · u · kh</small></div>
  <div class="ig-card m"><i>🆕</i><b>Ж Ш Щ Ц Ч</b><small>zh · sh · shch · ts · ch</small></div>
  <div class="ig-card pl"><i>🎵</i><b>Ы Э Ю Я Ё</b><small>y · e · yu · ya · yo</small></div>
 </div>
 <div class="letters">
  <div class="letter"><b>В в</b><small>“v” as in van<br>вода</small></div>
  <div class="letter"><b>Н н</b><small>“n” as in no<br>нет</small></div>
  <div class="letter"><b>Р р</b><small>rolled “r”<br>парк</small></div>
  <div class="letter"><b>С с</b><small>“s” as in sun<br>сок</small></div>
  <div class="letter"><b>У у</b><small>“oo” as in moon<br>суп</small></div>
  <div class="letter"><b>Х х</b><small>“kh” as in loch<br>хлеб</small></div>
  <div class="letter"><b>Ы ы</b><small>say “i” with a smile + tongue back<br>ты</small></div>
  <div class="letter"><b>Ь ь</b><small>soft sign: no sound, makes the letter before it soft</small></div>
 </div></div>
 <div class="gram"><h4>The stress rule: unstressed О sounds like А</h4>
 <div class="ig-tldr">Only the stressed syllable is strong. An <b>о</b> without stress sounds like <b>а</b>.</div>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip">молоко<small>you write</small></span><span class="ig-op">→</span><span class="ig-chip hl">ма-ла-КО<small>you say</small></span></div>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip">Москва<small>you write</small></span><span class="ig-op">→</span><span class="ig-chip hl">мас-КВА<small>you say</small></span></div>
 <div class="ig-memo"><i>🔊</i><p>Tap 🔊 on every word card and copy the music of the word, not the spelling.</p></div></div>
 <div class="gram"><h4>Кто это? · Что это?</h4>
 <div class="ig-vs"><div><h5>🧑 🐱 Кто? = who</h5><p>people and animals</p><p>Кто это? — Это <b class="hl">мама</b>.</p></div><div><h5>☕ 🏠 Что? = what</h5><p>things</p><p>Что это? — Это <b class="hl">кофе</b>.</p></div></div>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip">Это</span><span class="ig-op">+</span><span class="ig-chip hl">кот</span><span class="ig-op">=</span><span class="ig-chip">This is a cat<small>no “is”, no “a”!</small></span></div>
 <div class="ig-dont">Что это? — Это мама.</div><div class="ig-do">Кто это? — Это мама.</div></div>`,
