 grammar:()=>`
 <div class="gram"><h4>ты or вы?</h4>
 <div class="ig-tldr"><b>ты</b> = one friend. <b>вы</b> = polite, or more than one person.</div>
 <div class="ig-cards">
  <div class="ig-card n"><i>🧒</i><b>ты</b><small>friends, family, children</small></div>
  <div class="ig-card m"><i>👩‍🏫</i><b>вы</b><small>teacher, boss, a stranger</small></div>
  <div class="ig-card pl"><i>👨‍👩‍👧</i><b>вы</b><small>two or more people</small></div>
 </div>
 <div class="ig-vs"><div><h5>🙂 Friendly</h5><p>Привет! Как <b class="hl">тебя</b> зовут?</p><p>Пока!</p></div><div><h5>🎩 Polite</h5><p>Здравствуйте! Как <b class="hl">вас</b> зовут?</p><p>До свидания!</p></div></div>
 <div class="ig-memo"><i>🤝</i><p>Not sure? Use <b>вы</b>. When Russians want to be friends they say «Давай на ты!»</p></div></div>
 <div class="gram"><h4>“My name is…” = “They call me…”</h4>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip hl">Меня<small>me</small></span><span class="ig-op">+</span><span class="ig-chip">зовут<small>they call</small></span><span class="ig-op">+</span><span class="ig-chip">Майкл</span><span class="ig-op">=</span><span class="ig-chip">My name is Michael</span></div>
 <div class="ig-cards"><div class="ig-card"><i>🙋</i><b>меня</b><small>me</small></div><div class="ig-card"><i>👉</i><b>тебя</b><small>you (friend)</small></div><div class="ig-card"><i>🎩</i><b>вас</b><small>you (polite)</small></div><div class="ig-card m"><i>👨</i><b>его</b><small>him</small></div><div class="ig-card f"><i>👩</i><b>её</b><small>her</small></div></div></div>
 <div class="gram"><h4>Where from? из + country</h4>
 <div class="ig-tldr">After <b>из</b> (from) the country changes its ending.</div>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip m">Казахстан</span><span class="ig-op">→</span><span class="ig-chip hl">из Казахстан<b>а</b></span></div>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip f">Россия</span><span class="ig-op">→</span><span class="ig-chip hl">из Росси<b>и</b></span></div>
 <div class="ig-row"><span class="ig-chip f">Англия</span><span class="ig-op">→</span><span class="ig-chip hl">из Англи<b>и</b></span></div>
 <div class="ig-dont">Я из Казахстан.</div><div class="ig-do">Я из Казахстана.</div></div>`,
